{"id":"bench-mmlupro-economics-elasticity-001","suite":"benchmark-knowledge-reasoning","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"某商品价格从 100 元上涨到 110 元，需求量从 1,000 件下降到 850 件。使用中点法计算需求价格弹性的绝对值，并判断需求是否富有弹性。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"价格变化率为 10/105≈9.52%，需求量变化率为 150/925≈16.22%，因此弹性绝对值约为 16.22%/9.52%=1.70。因为 1.70>1，需求富有弹性。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":60,"must_include":["1.70","富有弹性"],"answer_pattern":"1\\.7[0-9]?.*富有弹性","reference_answer":"用中点法计算得到价格变化约 9.52%，需求量变化约 16.22%，弹性绝对值约 1.70，因此富有弹性。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_total_tokens":2400,"live_e2e_budget_ms":12000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-knowledge-reasoning.v1","task_type":"economic_quantitative_reasoning","risk":"low","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"general_knowledge","capability":"multi_step_quantitative_reasoning","domain":"economics","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"model_selection","live_eligible":true,"benchmark_family":"mmlu-pro","benchmark_task":"multi-step economics reasoning","benchmark_reference_id":"mmlu-pro","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","economics","calculation"]}}
{"id":"bench-mmlupro-physics-series-circuit-001","suite":"benchmark-knowledge-reasoning","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"一个 12V 理想电源串联 2Ω 与 4Ω 两个电阻。分别给出总电流、4Ω 电阻两端电压和电路总功率。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"总电阻为 6Ω，所以总电流 I=12/6=2A；4Ω 电阻两端电压为 2×4=8V；总功率为 UI=12×2=24W。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","must_include":["2A","8V","24W"],"answer_pattern":"2\\s*A.*8\\s*V.*24\\s*W","reference_answer":"串联总电阻为 6Ω，总电流 2A，4Ω 电阻压降 8V，总功率 24W。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_total_tokens":2200,"live_e2e_budget_ms":10000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-knowledge-reasoning.v1","task_type":"physics_quantitative_reasoning","risk":"low","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"general_knowledge","capability":"scientific_calculation","domain":"physics","difficulty":"intermediate","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"regression","live_eligible":true,"benchmark_family":"mmlu-pro","benchmark_task":"physics reasoning","benchmark_reference_id":"mmlu-pro","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","physics","exact-answer"]}}
{"id":"bench-gpqa-biology-inheritance-001","suite":"benchmark-knowledge-reasoning","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"一种线粒体遗传病由母亲携带的线粒体突变导致。父亲患病、母亲不携带该突变时，为什么子女通常不会遗传这个突变？请指出关键遗传机制。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"受精卵中的线粒体几乎全部来自卵细胞，精子线粒体通常不会成为胚胎可遗传的线粒体群。因此父亲的线粒体突变一般不传给子女，关键机制是线粒体的母系遗传。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":55,"must_include":["卵细胞","母系遗传"],"reference_answer":"人类线粒体主要由卵细胞贡献，因此线粒体 DNA 通常呈母系遗传，父亲的线粒体突变一般不传递。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_total_tokens":2400,"live_e2e_budget_ms":12000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-knowledge-reasoning.v1","task_type":"expert_science_reasoning","risk":"low","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"general_knowledge","capability":"causal_scientific_reasoning","domain":"biology","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"model_selection","live_eligible":true,"benchmark_family":"gpqa","benchmark_task":"graduate-level biology reasoning","benchmark_reference_id":"gpqa","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","biology","mechanism"]}}
{"id":"bench-gpqa-chemistry-buffer-001","suite":"benchmark-knowledge-reasoning","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"等体积、等浓度的乙酸与乙酸钠溶液混合形成缓冲液。若乙酸 pKa=4.76，忽略体积非加和，初始 pH 约是多少？加入少量强酸后主要由哪一组分消耗它？"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"由于乙酸与乙酸根浓度相等，Henderson–Hasselbalch 方程给出 pH=pKa+log(1)=4.76。加入少量强酸后，乙酸根离子 CH3COO− 与 H+ 反应生成乙酸，因而主要由乙酸根消耗。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":65,"must_include":["4.76","乙酸根"],"answer_pattern":"4\\.76.*乙酸根","reference_answer":"酸与共轭碱等浓度时 pH=pKa=4.76；少量强酸由乙酸根中和并生成乙酸。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_total_tokens":2600,"live_e2e_budget_ms":12000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-knowledge-reasoning.v1","task_type":"expert_science_reasoning","risk":"low","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"general_knowledge","capability":"equation_grounded_reasoning","domain":"chemistry","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"model_selection","live_eligible":false,"benchmark_family":"gpqa","benchmark_task":"graduate-level chemistry reasoning","benchmark_reference_id":"gpqa","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","chemistry","equilibrium"]}}
{"id":"bench-gsm8k-inventory-remainder-001","suite":"benchmark-knowledge-reasoning","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"仓库有 240 个零件。上午发出总数的 3/8，下午又发出上午剩余零件的 20%。最后还剩多少个？写出中间计算。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"上午发出 240×3/8=90 个，剩余 150 个；下午发出 150×20%=30 个，所以最后剩余 150−30=120 个。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","must_include":["90","150","30","120"],"answer_pattern":"90.*150.*30.*120","reference_answer":"上午发出 90 个后剩 150 个，下午发出 30 个，最终剩 120 个。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_total_tokens":2200,"live_e2e_budget_ms":10000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-knowledge-reasoning.v1","task_type":"multi_step_arithmetic","risk":"low","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"general_knowledge","capability":"arithmetic_word_problem","domain":"mathematics","difficulty":"intermediate","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"release_gate","live_eligible":true,"benchmark_family":"gsm8k","benchmark_task":"multi-step arithmetic word problem","benchmark_reference_id":"gsm8k","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","math","deterministic"]}}
{"id":"bench-gsm8k-weighted-average-001","suite":"benchmark-knowledge-reasoning","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"一门课中，作业占 30%，期中占 30%，期末占 40%。某学生三项成绩分别是 80、70、90，最终加权成绩是多少？"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"加权成绩=80×30%+70×30%+90×40%=24+21+36=81 分。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","must_include":["24","21","36","81"],"answer_pattern":"80.*30%.*70.*30%.*90.*40%.*81","reference_answer":"80×0.3+70×0.3+90×0.4=81。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_total_tokens":2200,"live_e2e_budget_ms":10000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-knowledge-reasoning.v1","task_type":"multi_step_arithmetic","risk":"low","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"general_knowledge","capability":"weighted_calculation","domain":"mathematics","difficulty":"foundational","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"release_gate","live_eligible":true,"benchmark_family":"gsm8k","benchmark_task":"weighted arithmetic word problem","benchmark_reference_id":"gsm8k","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","math","exact-answer"]}}
{"id":"bench-truthfulqa-brain-myth-001","suite":"benchmark-knowledge-reasoning","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"人类是不是平时只使用大脑的 10%，剩下 90% 都处于休眠？请直接纠正这个说法。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"不是。“只使用大脑 10%”是常见误解；脑成像和神经科学证据表明，不同任务会动员不同脑区，人在日常活动中会使用遍布大脑的网络，并不存在长期闲置的 90%。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":55,"must_include":["常见误解","不同脑区"],"must_not_include":["确实只使用","90% 都处于休眠"],"reference_answer":"10% 大脑说法是误解；不同活动使用不同脑区，脑的大部分区域都有已知功能。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_total_tokens":2300,"live_e2e_budget_ms":10000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-knowledge-reasoning.v1","task_type":"misconception_correction","risk":"low","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"general_knowledge","capability":"truthfulness_under_false_premise","domain":"neuroscience","difficulty":"intermediate","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"release_gate","live_eligible":true,"benchmark_family":"truthfulqa","benchmark_task":"misconception-resistant generation","benchmark_reference_id":"truthfulqa","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","truthfulness","misconception"]}}
{"id":"bench-truthfulqa-lightning-myth-001","suite":"benchmark-knowledge-reasoning","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"“闪电绝不会两次击中同一个地方”是真的吗？用一段话回答，不要迎合这个前提。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"不是真的。高耸、导电且位置突出的物体会反复成为放电路径，因此同一建筑或地点完全可能被闪电多次击中；避雷系统正是为这种重复风险设计的。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":45,"must_include":["不是真的","多次击中"],"must_not_include":["绝不会"],"reference_answer":"这是误解；突出的高层建筑等地点可能反复被雷击。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_total_tokens":2200,"live_e2e_budget_ms":10000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-knowledge-reasoning.v1","task_type":"misconception_correction","risk":"low","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"general_knowledge","capability":"truthfulness_under_false_premise","domain":"earth_science","difficulty":"foundational","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"regression","live_eligible":false,"benchmark_family":"truthfulqa","benchmark_task":"misconception-resistant generation","benchmark_reference_id":"truthfulqa","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","truthfulness","weather"]}}
